---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | LinkWA" description="LinkWA privacy policy. Your phone number is never stored on our servers. All processing happens in your browser.">
<div class="container" style="max-width:680px;padding-top:4rem;padding-bottom:5rem;">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: June 2025</em></p>
    <h2>What data we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>None.</strong> LinkWA processes your phone number and message entirely in your browser using JavaScript. Nothing is sent to our servers. We do not store, log, or transmit your phone number or message content.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>LinkWA does not use cookies for tracking or personalisation. If we add Google AdSense in future, AdSense may use cookies to serve relevant ads — this is governed by Google's privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We may use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate traffic patterns (page views, session duration, device types). This data is anonymised and does not include your phone number or any tool inputs.</p>
    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>The QR code is generated using the open-source QRCode.js library, loaded from Cloudflare CDN. No data is sent to Cloudflare as part of QR generation.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>LinkWA is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact us via the WhatsApp link on the homepage.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
